Changes made to Questions.
Question Revisions
Index 35

Original:
What was the primary form of the report as it was submitted?

First revision:
In what form was the report required under subsection (a) submitted?

Final revision:
How did the report required under subsection (a) combine a classified annex with a one-page unclassified summary?

Index 53

Original:
What were the two primary objectives of the review?

Final revision:
What were the two primary objectives of the review of the Department of Veterans Affairs’ pension program?

Index 55

Original:
What information is presented in Appendix V?

First revision:
What does Appendix V explain about states’ use of property-record searches to verify applicants’ assets?

Corrected revision:
What does Appendix V explain about states’ use of property-record searches to verify applicants’ assets?

Index 67 (FAIL)

Original:
According to the decision, under what conditions may states regulate?

First revision:
According to the decision concerning the Federal Power Act, when may states regulate matters that affect areas within FERC’s authority?

Final revision:
Under the Federal Power Act ruling in Hughes v. Talen Energy Marketing, when may states regulate within their congressionally assigned authority despite incidental effects on matters regulated by FERC?

Index 85

Original:
What information is only partially provided concerning challenges presented to acquisition organizations?

First revision:
What information is unavailable or incomplete regarding protests submitted to federal procuring agencies?

Final revision:
What information is unavailable or incomplete regarding protests submitted to federal procuring agencies?

Index 99

Original:
What was the principal format in which the report was submitted?

First revision:
In what format was the report submitted under subsection (a)?

Final revision:
What portions of the report submitted under subsection (a) consisted of a classified annex and a one-page unclassified summary?

